  "body": "### What is the issue with the Infra Standard?\n\nIn the Infra spec, some types like maps have [clone methods](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#map-clone), but [structs](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#structs) don't seem to have one. Is it useful to have a clone method for structs as well?\r\nFor context, [a spec PR for Protected Audience](https://github.com/WICG/turtledove/pull/1080/files#diff-6f5a1d8263b0b0c42e2716ba5750e3652e359532647ac934c1c70086ae3ceddaR1647) wants to clone a struct, and there's a [discussion about filing a request](https://github.com/WICG/turtledove/pull/1080#discussion_r1523265425) for it.",
